
@rule move.invite.dislike
on move.invite
when likes=no
- Suggest doing something she'd like more
- Ask what she'd rather do
- Offer to do something else together

@rule move.invite.state.dislike
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=state likes=no
- Ask what she'd rather do instead
- Suggest something she'd actually enjoy

@rule move.invite.state.dislike.nurse
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=state likes=no job=nurse
- Ask what she does to unwind instead
- Ask what she'd rather do after work

@rule move.invite.state.dislike.teacher
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=state likes=no role=teacher
- Ask what she does to unwind instead
- Ask what she'd rather do after class

@rule move.praise.dislike
on move.praise
when kind=small likes=no
- Say she's honest about what she likes
- Say you like that she knows her own mind

@rule move.share.state.dislike
on move.share
when kind=small shape=state likes=no
- Admit you're not into {like} either
- Say you never got {like} either

@rule move.share.state.dislike.nurse
on move.share
when kind=small shape=state likes=no job=nurse
- Admit you're not into {like} either, sensei
- Say you never got {like} either

@rule move.share.state.dislike.teacher
on move.share
when kind=small shape=state likes=no role=teacher
- Admit you're not into {like} either, sensei
- Say you never got {like} either

@rule react.invite.dislike.good
on react
when move=invite fit=good kind=small likes=no
feel smile
- Not {like}, but... something else? I'd like that.
- Okay, but I'm picking what we do. Deal?
- Anything but {like}, and I'm in.
- You'd change plans for me? ...Okay, yes.

@rule react.ask.dislike
on react
when move=ask likes=no fit=good step<=1
opens share,invite,praise
feel pout
- Honestly? {Like} just isn't for me. It never was.
- I tried {like} once. Once was enough.
- I don't hate it. I just don't get why people love it.
- Don't look at me like that. Some people just don't like {like}.

@rule react.shape.share.dislike
on react
when move=share fit=good|neutral shape=state likes=no
feel laugh
- Wait, you don't like {like} either? Finally, someone sane.
- Hehe. We can not like it together.
- Good. I was starting to think I was the only one.

@rule open.ctx.rainhater
on @open
when rainlover=no wet=yes
- Ugh, this rain...
- My hair's ruined. Don't look.
- Sorry, I'm damp and grumpy.
- Can we talk inside? Oh, we are inside. Still.

@rule meopen.ctx.rainhater
on @meopen
when rainlover=no wet=yes
- You look soaked.
- I'll keep it short so you can dry off.
- Rain got you too, huh.
- Nasty weather.

@rule tail.rainhater
on @tail
when rainlover=no wet=yes
- Talking helped. The rain didn't.
- At least you made today less gray.
- Okay. Now I just need it to stop raining.
- Thanks. I'll survive this weather.

@rule day.h.rain_hater
on day
when kind=day wet=yes rainlover=no
hook rain_hater
opens ask,comfort,share
feel pout
- Rain again. My shoes are soaked through.
- I hate days like this. Everything's wet and gray.
- My umbrella flipped inside out on the way here. Great start.

@rule move.h.rain_hater.ask
on move.ask
when hook=rain_hater
- Ask if she got caught in it

@rule react.h.rain_hater.ask
on react
when hook=rain_hater move=ask fit=good|neutral
- On the way in. Completely.
- The bus splashed me. On purpose, I swear.

@rule move.h.rain_hater.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=rain_hater
- Offer her your umbrella for the way home

@rule react.h.rain_hater.comfort
on react
when hook=rain_hater move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...You'd do that? Okay. Thank you.
- Then you'll get wet. ...Fine, we'll share it.

@rule move.h.rain_hater.share
on move.share
when hook=rain_hater
- Say you're not a fan of the rain either

@rule react.h.rain_hater.share
on react
when hook=rain_hater move=share fit=good|neutral
- Right? Who likes this?
- Finally, someone normal.

@rule react.h.rain_hater.bad
on react
when hook=rain_hater fit=bad
- Easy for you to say. You're dry.
- Just let me be grumpy.

@rule move.invite.ctx.rainhater
on move.invite
when rainlover=no wet=yes
- Suggest waiting out the rain somewhere warm
- Invite her to the cafeteria until it stops

@rule small.h.place_rooftop_rain_hater
on small
when subject=place placeid=rooftop wet=yes rainlover=no
hook place_rooftop_rain_hater
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel pout
shape state
- Why are we up here in the rain? Everything's wet.
- I only came up because I thought it had stopped. It hadn't.
- The bench is soaked. I'm not sitting there.

@rule me.h.place_rooftop_rain_hater
on me.small
when hook=place_rooftop_rain_hater
- It's pouring up here.
- Want to go back inside?

@rule move.h.place_rooftop_rain_hater.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_rooftop_rain_hater
- Ask why she came up at all

@rule react.h.place_rooftop_rain_hater.ask
on react
when hook=place_rooftop_rain_hater move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I wanted air. I got a shower.
- Habit. Bad habit, today.

@rule move.h.place_rooftop_rain_hater.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=place_rooftop_rain_hater
- Hold your jacket over her head

@rule react.h.place_rooftop_rain_hater.comfort
on react
when hook=place_rooftop_rain_hater move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Okay, that's sweet. Don't let go.
- You'll get wet. ...Thanks, though.

@rule move.h.place_rooftop_rain_hater.invite
on move.invite
when hook=place_rooftop_rain_hater
- Suggest going back inside

@rule react.h.place_rooftop_rain_hater.invite
on react
when hook=place_rooftop_rain_hater move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes. Please. Right now.
- Finally, a good idea.

@rule react.h.place_rooftop_rain_hater.bad
on react
when hook=place_rooftop_rain_hater fit=bad
- You could've warned me.
- Stop smiling. It's not funny.

@rule small.h.weather_rain_hater
on small
when subject=weather wet=yes rainlover=no
hook weather_rain_hater
opens ask,comfort,share
feel pout
shape state
- I hate this rain. Everything smells like wet socks.
- My hair takes an hour, and the rain ruined it in a minute.
- They said it'd stop by noon. It didn't.

@rule me.h.weather_rain_hater
on me.small
when hook=weather_rain_hater
- Some rain, huh?
- This weather's awful.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_hater.ask
on move.ask
when hook=weather_rain_hater
- Ask what she hates most about it

@rule react.h.weather_rain_hater.ask
on react
when hook=weather_rain_hater move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The wet shoes. All day in wet shoes.
- My hair. Don't look at my hair.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_hater.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=weather_rain_hater
- Say she still looks fine to you

@rule react.h.weather_rain_hater.comfort
on react
when hook=weather_rain_hater move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Liar. ...Thanks, though.
- You're just saying that. Keep saying it.

@rule move.h.weather_rain_hater.share
on move.share
when hook=weather_rain_hater
- Say you'd rather be inside somewhere warm

@rule react.h.weather_rain_hater.share
on react
when hook=weather_rain_hater move=share fit=good|neutral
- With a blanket. And tea. Yes.
- Don't make me want it more.

@rule react.h.weather_rain_hater.bad
on react
when hook=weather_rain_hater fit=bad
- You like this? Seriously?
- Then go dance in it. Without me.

@rule small.h.commute_rain_lover
on small
when subject=commute wet=yes rainlover=yes
hook commute_rain_lover
opens ask,share,tease
feel smile
shape state
- I walked in the rain this morning. On purpose. Best commute all week.
- I left the umbrella closed the whole way. Don't tell my mom.
- Rainy mornings are the only ones I like walking to school.

@rule me.h.commute_rain_lover
on me.small
when hook=commute_rain_lover
- You came in this rain?
- How was the walk in?

@rule move.h.commute_rain_lover.ask
on move.ask
when hook=commute_rain_lover
- Ask what she likes about walking in the rain

@rule react.h.commute_rain_lover.ask
on react
when hook=commute_rain_lover move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everyone hides, and the streets are mine.
- The sound on the umbrella. Or on my head. Both.

@rule move.h.commute_rain_lover.share
on move.share
when hook=commute_rain_lover
- Say you took the long way too

@rule react.h.commute_rain_lover.share
on react
when hook=commute_rain_lover move=share fit=good|neutral
- Really? Then you get it.
- One of us, then.

@rule move.h.commute_rain_lover.tease
on move.tease
when hook=commute_rain_lover
- Say she looks like a happy wet puppy

@rule react.h.commute_rain_lover.tease
on react
when hook=commute_rain_lover move=tease fit=good|neutral
- ...Hey! ...Okay, that's accurate.
- Woof. Happy now?

@rule react.h.commute_rain_lover.bad
on react
when hook=commute_rain_lover fit=bad
- You'd never understand.
- Fine. Stay dry and boring.

@rule day.h.animals_scared
on day
when mood=cheerful l_animals!=yes
hook animals_scared
opens ask,tease,comfort
feel laugh
- A dog jumped at me at the gate! I screamed. Everyone laughed. I'm laughing now too.
- The courtyard cat followed me all morning. I don't know why it picked me.
- Someone brought a hamster to class. I sat as far away as I could. Today was still good, though.

@rule move.h.animals_scared.ask
on move.ask
when hook=animals_scared
- Ask what happened with the dog

@rule react.h.animals_scared.ask
on react
when hook=animals_scared move=ask fit=good|neutral
- It was tiny. It wagged at me. I still ran.
- Its owner apologized. The dog didn't.

@rule move.h.animals_scared.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=animals_scared
- Say you'll walk in with her past the gate

@rule react.h.animals_scared.comfort
on react
when hook=animals_scared move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Okay. You can be my shield.
- You'd stand between me and a dog? My hero.

@rule move.h.animals_scared.tease
on move.tease
when hook=animals_scared
- Say the animals must like her

@rule react.h.animals_scared.tease
on react
when hook=animals_scared move=tease fit=good|neutral
- That's the problem. I don't like them back.
- Then they have bad taste.

@rule react.h.animals_scared.bad
on react
when hook=animals_scared fit=bad
- Don't laugh. It was scary.
- You'd scream too.

@rule day.h.coffee_not_sleepy
on day
when mood=sleepy l_coffee!=yes
hook coffee_not_sleepy
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel worried
- I'm so sleepy... and no, I won't drink coffee. It's too bitter.
- Everyone keeps offering me coffee. I can't stand the taste. I'll just suffer.
- I tried coffee to stay awake. Now I'm sleepy and my mouth tastes bad.

@rule move.h.coffee_not_sleepy.ask
on move.ask
when hook=coffee_not_sleepy
- Ask what keeps her awake instead

@rule react.h.coffee_not_sleepy.ask
on react
when hook=coffee_not_sleepy move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Cold water on my face. And pinching myself.
- Tea, sometimes. Sweet tea.

@rule move.h.coffee_not_sleepy.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=coffee_not_sleepy
- Tell her to rest her eyes for a minute

@rule react.h.coffee_not_sleepy.comfort
on react
when hook=coffee_not_sleepy move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Just a minute. Wake me up?
- If I fall asleep, it's your fault.

@rule move.h.coffee_not_sleepy.invite
on move.invite
when hook=coffee_not_sleepy
- Offer to get her a sweet tea instead

@rule react.h.coffee_not_sleepy.invite
on react
when hook=coffee_not_sleepy move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Sweet tea? ...Yes. Please.
- Not coffee? Then yes.

@rule react.h.coffee_not_sleepy.bad
on react
when hook=coffee_not_sleepy fit=bad
- Just drink it, you say. Easy for you.
- I said I don't like coffee.

@rule day.h.cooking_burnt
on day
when mood=none|cheerful l_cooking!=yes
hook cooking_burnt
opens ask,tease,invite
feel laugh
- I tried to make my own lunch today. The rice was crunchy. Never again.
- My mom made me cook breakfast. The pan is still soaking.
- Home economics was today. My group banned me from the stove.

@rule move.h.cooking_burnt.ask
on move.ask
when hook=cooking_burnt
- Ask what went wrong

@rule react.h.cooking_burnt.ask
on react
when hook=cooking_burnt move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everything. I don't know how.
- I read the recipe. The recipe lied.

@rule move.h.cooking_burnt.invite
on move.invite
when hook=cooking_burnt
- Offer to buy her lunch instead

@rule react.h.cooking_burnt.invite
on react
when hook=cooking_burnt move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes. Please. Food someone else made.
- Deal. I'll stay away from kitchens.

@rule move.h.cooking_burnt.tease
on move.tease
when hook=cooking_burnt
- Say you'd still eat it

@rule react.h.cooking_burnt.tease
on react
when hook=cooking_burnt move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Then you're braver than my family.
- You'd regret it. Trust me.

@rule react.h.cooking_burnt.bad
on react
when hook=cooking_burnt fit=bad
- Hey, it's not funny! ...It's a little funny.
- You try cooking, then.

@rule day.h.exercise_lazy
on day
when mood=bored l_exercise!=yes
hook exercise_lazy
opens ask,invite,tease
feel pout
- P.E. was laps again. I walked the whole time. So boring.
- Everyone's training for the sports day. I'd rather sit and watch clouds.
- The coach made me run. I don't run. I walked fast. That counts.

@rule move.h.exercise_lazy.ask
on move.ask
when hook=exercise_lazy
- Ask what she'd rather do

@rule react.h.exercise_lazy.ask
on react
when hook=exercise_lazy move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Anything sitting down. A movie. A nap.
- Something that doesn't make me sweat.

@rule move.h.exercise_lazy.invite
on move.invite
when hook=exercise_lazy
- Suggest doing something lazy together

@rule react.h.exercise_lazy.invite
on react
when hook=exercise_lazy move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Lazy? With you? Yes.
- Now that I'm in for.

@rule move.h.exercise_lazy.tease
on move.tease
when hook=exercise_lazy
- Say walking fast is still exercise

@rule react.h.exercise_lazy.tease
on react
when hook=exercise_lazy move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Exactly! Tell the coach that.
- See? You get it.

@rule react.h.exercise_lazy.bad
on react
when hook=exercise_lazy fit=bad
- Don't tell me to try harder.
- You sound like the coach.

@rule day.h.flirty_plain
on day
when mood=flirty l_fashion!=yes
hook flirty_plain
opens ask,tease,praise
feel shy
- I didn't do anything special today. Same uniform, same hair. You still keep looking.
- Clothes are just clothes to me. So if you're staring, it's not the outfit.
- My friend wanted to do my makeup. I said no. You don't mind, right?

@rule move.h.flirty_plain.ask
on move.ask
when hook=flirty_plain
- Ask why she never dresses up

@rule react.h.flirty_plain.ask
on react
when hook=flirty_plain move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Too much work. I'd rather sleep in.
- I don't know how, honestly.

@rule move.h.flirty_plain.tease
on move.tease
when hook=flirty_plain
- Say it's definitely not the outfit

@rule react.h.flirty_plain.tease
on react
when hook=flirty_plain move=tease fit=good|neutral
- ...Then what is it? Say it.
- Hehe. Good answer.

@rule move.h.flirty_plain.praise
on move.praise
when hook=flirty_plain
- Say she doesn't need to dress up

@rule react.h.flirty_plain.praise
on react
when hook=flirty_plain move=praise fit=good|neutral
- ...You mean that? Okay. Good.
- Smooth. I'll take it.

@rule react.h.flirty_plain.bad
on react
when hook=flirty_plain fit=bad
- So I look plain. Thanks.
- Wow. Okay.

@rule day.h.fashion_plain
on day
when mood=none|cheerful l_fashion!=yes
hook fashion_plain
opens ask,share,tease
feel smile
- My friends dragged me to the clothing store again. I sat outside and ate a crepe.
- Everyone's talking about some new brand. I just nod. I have no idea.
- I wore the same hoodie all weekend. Comfort wins.

@rule move.h.fashion_plain.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fashion_plain
- Ask what she did while they shopped

@rule react.h.fashion_plain.ask
on react
when hook=fashion_plain move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Ate. People-watched. Best part of the trip.
- Held the bags. I'm a professional bag holder.

@rule move.h.fashion_plain.share
on move.share
when hook=fashion_plain
- Say you don't care about brands either

@rule react.h.fashion_plain.share
on react
when hook=fashion_plain move=share fit=good|neutral
- Thank you! Clothes are clothes.
- Finally, someone gets it.

@rule move.h.fashion_plain.tease
on move.tease
when hook=fashion_plain
- Say she's a hoodie girl through and through

@rule react.h.fashion_plain.tease
on react
when hook=fashion_plain move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Guilty. And proud.
- Don't knock the hoodie.

@rule react.h.fashion_plain.bad
on react
when hook=fashion_plain fit=bad
- Don't you start too.
- I don't need fashion advice.

@rule day.h.food_picky
on day
when mood=hungry l_food!=yes
hook food_picky
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel worried
- I'm hungry, but nothing sounds good. I'm a picky eater.
- I skipped lunch again. I just don't like eating much. Now my stomach's angry.
- Everyone was eating at lunch and I just had juice. Food's a chore to me.

@rule move.h.food_picky.ask
on move.ask
when hook=food_picky
- Ask if there's anything she does like to eat

@rule react.h.food_picky.ask
on react
when hook=food_picky move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Plain rice. Maybe some soup. That's it.
- Bread. Plain bread. Don't judge.

@rule move.h.food_picky.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=food_picky
- Say she should eat something small anyway

@rule react.h.food_picky.comfort
on react
when hook=food_picky move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Okay. Something small. For you.
- Fine. One onigiri. Happy?

@rule move.h.food_picky.invite
on move.invite
when hook=food_picky
- Offer to get her something light

@rule react.h.food_picky.invite
on react
when hook=food_picky move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Light? ...That I could eat. Thanks.
- Nothing heavy, okay? Then yes.

@rule react.h.food_picky.bad
on react
when hook=food_picky fit=bad
- Don't lecture me about eating.
- I know. I'm not a kid.

@rule day.h.spicy_mild
on day
when mood=hungry l_spicy!=yes
hook spicy_mild
opens ask,tease,invite
feel pout
- The cafeteria only had curry. Spicy curry. I'm still starving.
- I took one bite of the mapo tofu and cried. Now I'm hungry and sad.
- Why does everything good have chili in it? I just want something mild.

@rule move.h.spicy_mild.ask
on move.ask
when hook=spicy_mild
- Ask what she can eat when it's like that

@rule react.h.spicy_mild.ask
on react
when hook=spicy_mild move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Rice. Plain rice. And milk. Lots of milk.
- Anything that doesn't fight back.

@rule move.h.spicy_mild.invite
on move.invite
when hook=spicy_mild
- Offer to find her something mild

@rule react.h.spicy_mild.invite
on react
when hook=spicy_mild move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Please. Something that won't hurt me.
- Yes. A sweet bun. Anything.

@rule move.h.spicy_mild.tease
on move.tease
when hook=spicy_mild
- Say her face must have been red

@rule react.h.spicy_mild.tease
on react
when hook=spicy_mild move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Like a tomato. Don't laugh.
- I'm still recovering.

@rule react.h.spicy_mild.bad
on react
when hook=spicy_mild fit=bad
- Spicy isn't brave, it's painful.
- Don't tell me to try it again.

@rule day.h.rain_bookbored
on day
when kind=day wet=yes placeid=library l_study!=yes
hook rain_bookbored
opens ask,invite,tease
feel pout
- Stuck in the library because of the rain. I don't even like books.
- Everyone came here to stay dry. Now I'm surrounded by people studying. Help.
- The rain trapped me with the textbooks. Worst prison ever.

@rule move.h.rain_bookbored.ask
on move.ask
when hook=rain_bookbored
- Ask why she didn't go somewhere else

@rule react.h.rain_bookbored.ask
on react
when hook=rain_bookbored move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everywhere else is packed. This was the last dry spot.
- My umbrella's broken. So, here.

@rule move.h.rain_bookbored.invite
on move.invite
when hook=rain_bookbored
- Suggest sneaking out to the cafeteria

@rule react.h.rain_bookbored.invite
on react
when hook=rain_bookbored move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes. Lead the way. Quietly.
- Finally, an escape plan.

@rule move.h.rain_bookbored.tease
on move.tease
when hook=rain_bookbored
- Say she could at least pretend to read

@rule react.h.rain_bookbored.tease
on react
when hook=rain_bookbored move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I am. The book's upside down.
- I've been on the same page for an hour.

@rule react.h.rain_bookbored.bad
on react
when hook=rain_bookbored fit=bad
- Shh. The librarian's watching.
- Don't make me study.

@rule day.h.rain_bookfight_bored
on day
when kind=day wet=yes placeid=library l_study!=yes fight=yes
hook rain_bookfight_bored
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel sad
- I came here to avoid {fightwho}, and now the rain won't let me leave. And I hate studying.
- Hiding in the library because of {fightwho}. With books. In the rain. Perfect day.

@rule move.h.rain_bookfight_bored.ask
on move.ask
when hook=rain_bookfight_bored
- Ask what happened with {fightwho}

@rule react.h.rain_bookfight_bored.ask
on react
when hook=rain_bookfight_bored move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Long story. I don't want to talk about it here.
- We said things. Both of us.

@rule move.h.rain_bookfight_bored.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=rain_bookfight_bored
- Sit with her for a while

@rule react.h.rain_bookfight_bored.comfort
on react
when hook=rain_bookfight_bored move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Okay. Just sit. No studying.
- Thanks. It's better with someone here.

@rule move.h.rain_bookfight_bored.invite
on move.invite
when hook=rain_bookfight_bored
- Suggest leaving once the rain eases

@rule react.h.rain_bookfight_bored.invite
on react
when hook=rain_bookfight_bored move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes. Anywhere but here.
- When it stops, we're gone.

@rule react.h.rain_bookfight_bored.bad
on react
when hook=rain_bookfight_bored fit=bad
- Don't bring {fightwho} up.
- Please don't lecture me.

@rule day.h.sweets_not_hungry
on day
when mood=hungry l_sweets!=yes
hook sweets_not_hungry
opens ask,invite,comfort
feel pout
- I'm hungry and all anyone has is candy. I don't even like sweets.
- My friend gave me cake. I gave it back. I need real food.
- Valentine chocolate leftovers everywhere. I want rice.

@rule move.h.sweets_not_hungry.ask
on move.ask
when hook=sweets_not_hungry
- Ask what she's craving

@rule react.h.sweets_not_hungry.ask
on react
when hook=sweets_not_hungry move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Something salty. Chips. Rice crackers.
- Real food. Meat. Something warm.

@rule move.h.sweets_not_hungry.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=sweets_not_hungry
- Say you'll find her real food

