- I only come here when I have to. The silence makes me nervous.
- Books make me sleepy. The chairs here don't help.

@rule me.h.place_library_books_bored
on me.small
when hook=place_library_books_bored
- You're in the library?
- Here to study?

@rule move.h.place_library_books_bored.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_library_books_bored
- Ask why she's here, then

@rule react.h.place_library_books_bored.ask
on react
when hook=place_library_books_bored move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Homework. Against my will.
- My friend dragged me. She's studying. I'm not.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_bored.invite
on move.invite
when hook=place_library_books_bored
