@rule react.h.place_library_books_bored.invite
on react
when hook=place_library_books_bored move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes. Anywhere with noise.
- Please. Before I fall asleep.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_bored.tease
on move.tease
when hook=place_library_books_bored
- Say she looks like she's about to fall asleep

@rule react.h.place_library_books_bored.tease
