- Don't tell the librarian.

@rule react.h.place_library_books_bored.bad
on react
when hook=place_library_books_bored fit=bad
- Shh. Don't make me study.
- Don't lecture me about books.

@rule small.h.place_library_books_rain_bored
on small
when subject=place placeid=library l_study!=yes wet=yes
hook place_library_books_rain_bored
opens ask,tease,invite
feel pout
shape state
- The rain chased me in here. Now I'm stuck with the books.
- Raining outside, boring inside. Great choices.
- Everyone came here to stay dry. I came to complain.

@rule me.h.place_library_books_rain_bored
on me.small
when hook=place_library_books_rain_bored
- Hiding from the rain?
- You came in to stay dry?

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_bored.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_library_books_rain_bored
- Ask how long she's been stuck here

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_bored.ask
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_bored move=ask fit=good|neutral
