- Since lunch. Send help.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_bored.invite
on move.invite
when hook=place_library_books_rain_bored
- Suggest waiting it out in the cafeteria

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_bored.invite
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_bored move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes. With hot drinks. Go.
- Finally, a plan.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_bored.tease
on move.tease
when hook=place_library_books_rain_bored
- Say the books are better company than the rain

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_bored.tease
