- I've read this page five times. Nothing's going in.
- Everyone else looks so calm. I just want the exams to be over.

@rule me.h.place_library_books_exam_cram
on me.small
when hook=place_library_books_exam_cram
- Studying for the exams?
- Cramming?

@rule move.h.place_library_books_exam_cram.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_library_books_exam_cram
- Ask which subject is giving her trouble

@rule react.h.place_library_books_exam_cram.ask
on react
when hook=place_library_books_exam_cram move=ask fit=good|neutral
