- Yes. My brain's melting.

@rule react.h.place_library_books_exam_cram.bad
on react
when hook=place_library_books_exam_cram fit=bad
- Don't tell me to study harder.
- I know. I'm trying.

@rule small.h.place_library_books_fight_hide
on small
when subject=place placeid=library l_study!=yes fight=yes
hook place_library_books_fight_hide
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel sad
shape state
- I don't even like the library. I came here because {fightwho} never comes here.
- Hiding behind a textbook. Not reading it. Just hiding.
- It's quiet here. Nobody asks what happened with {fightwho}.

@rule me.h.place_library_books_fight_hide
on me.small
when hook=place_library_books_fight_hide
- You're hiding in here?
- You okay?

@rule move.h.place_library_books_fight_hide.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_library_books_fight_hide
- Ask what happened with {fightwho}

@rule react.h.place_library_books_fight_hide.ask
on react
when hook=place_library_books_fight_hide move=ask fit=good|neutral
- We fought. I don't want to get into it.
- It was stupid. It still hurts.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_fight_hide.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=place_library_books_fight_hide
- Say you'll keep her company

@rule react.h.place_library_books_fight_hide.comfort
on react
when hook=place_library_books_fight_hide move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Thanks. Just don't make me read.
- Okay. Stay a little.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_fight_hide.invite
on move.invite
when hook=place_library_books_fight_hide
- Suggest going somewhere she'd like more

@rule react.h.place_library_books_fight_hide.invite
on react
when hook=place_library_books_fight_hide move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Somewhere {fightwho} isn't? Yes.
- Okay. Anywhere loud.

@rule react.h.place_library_books_fight_hide.bad
on react
when hook=place_library_books_fight_hide fit=bad
- Don't make me talk about it.
- I just want to be alone.

@rule small.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_hide
on small
when subject=place placeid=library l_study!=yes fight=yes wet=yes
hook place_library_books_rain_fight_hide
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel sad
shape state
- Rain outside, {fightwho} somewhere out there, and me in here with books I don't want.
- The rain's loud enough that I don't have to think about {fightwho}. Almost.

@rule me.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_hide
on me.small
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_hide
- Rough day?
- Stuck in here with the rain?

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_hide.ask
on move.ask
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_hide
- Ask if she wants to talk about {fightwho}

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_hide.ask
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_hide move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Not really. Later, maybe.
- ...It's my fault too. That's the worst part.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_hide.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_hide
- Sit with her until the rain stops

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_hide.comfort
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_hide move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Okay. Thanks for staying.
- You don't have to. ...But stay.

@rule move.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_hide.invite
on move.invite
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_hide
- Offer to walk her home under your umbrella

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_hide.invite
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_hide move=invite fit=good|neutral
- ...You'd do that? Yes.
- Okay. When it eases up.

@rule react.h.place_library_books_rain_fight_hide.bad
on react
when hook=place_library_books_rain_fight_hide fit=bad
- Please don't.
- I don't want advice.

@rule duo3.reply.pair.praise.other.cold
on duo3.reply
when act=praise q!=bad otherlikes=no
feel smile
- Hehe. {other} doesn't mind. See?
- Thanks. {other}, back me up here.
- ...You're sweet. {other}, isn't he sweet?
- (She smiles, then looks at {other} to share the joke.)
- Thanks! Even {other} agrees.
- Okay, that was nice.

@rule duo3.reply.good.other.cold
on duo3.reply
when q=good otherlikes=no act!=kiss
feel smile
- Thanks! {other}, you heard that, right?
- Hehe. {other} is rolling her eyes, but thanks.
- That's nice. {other}'s jealous, I bet. Kidding.
- (She laughs and nudges {other}.)
- Okay, you win this round.
- Aww. {other}, write that down.

@rule day.h.like_animals_good
on day
when newlike=animals low=no
hook like_animals_good
opens ask,share,invite
feel smile
- Good! I stopped at the pet shop window on the way in. There's a puppy there that knows me now.
- Pretty good. The courtyard cat sat on my lap during break. I didn't move for twenty minutes.
- Nice, actually. I spent lunch feeding the birds behind the gym.

@rule move.h.like_animals_good.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_animals_good
- Ask what the puppy looks like

@rule react.h.like_animals_good.ask
on react
when hook=like_animals_good move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Tiny, brown, and he tries to lick the glass.
- Floppy ears. He's perfect.

@rule move.h.like_animals_good.share
on move.share
when hook=like_animals_good
- Say you like animals too

@rule react.h.like_animals_good.share
on react
when hook=like_animals_good move=share fit=good|neutral
- Really? Then you have to come see him.
- Hehe. I knew there was a reason.

@rule move.h.like_animals_good.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_animals_good
- Suggest going to see it together after school

@rule react.h.like_animals_good.invite
on react
when hook=like_animals_good move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes! He's there until six.
- Okay! But he likes me best.

@rule react.h.like_animals_good.bad
on react
when hook=like_animals_good fit=bad
- You don't have to care. I do.
- Fine. I'll go see him alone.

@rule day.h.like_animals_low
on day
when newlike=animals low=yes
hook like_animals_low
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel sad
- Not great. The only good part was the stray cat by the gate letting me pet it.
- Bad. I just want to go home and hug my dog.
- Rough. I watched cat videos in the bathroom for ten minutes. It helped a little.

@rule move.h.like_animals_low.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_animals_low
- Ask about her dog

@rule react.h.like_animals_low.ask
on react
when hook=like_animals_low move=ask fit=good|neutral
- He's old and lazy and the best. He'll be waiting at the door.
- His name's Mame. He always knows when I'm sad.

@rule move.h.like_animals_low.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=like_animals_low
- Say the cat clearly picked her for a reason

@rule react.h.like_animals_low.comfort
on react
when hook=like_animals_low move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...You think so? That's nice.
- Hehe. She has good taste, then.

@rule move.h.like_animals_low.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_animals_low
- Offer to walk her home so she can see her dog sooner

@rule react.h.like_animals_low.invite
on react
when hook=like_animals_low move=invite fit=good|neutral
- ...Yes. He'd like you.
- Okay. Thank you.

@rule react.h.like_animals_low.bad
on react
when hook=like_animals_low fit=bad
- Never mind.
- It's silly, I know.

@rule day.h.like_food_good
on day
when newlike=food low=no
hook like_food_good
opens ask,share,invite
feel laugh
- Great! The cafeteria had fried chicken today and I got the last piece.
- Good! I had seconds at lunch. And thirds. Don't judge.
- I found a new bakery on the way to school. I've been thinking about it all day.

@rule move.h.like_food_good.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_food_good
- Ask what the bakery sells

@rule react.h.like_food_good.ask
on react
when hook=like_food_good move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Everything. The curry bread is huge.
- Cream buns as big as your face.

@rule move.h.like_food_good.share
on move.share
when hook=like_food_good
- Say you could eat all day too

@rule react.h.like_food_good.share
on react
when hook=like_food_good move=share fit=good|neutral
- Finally, someone who understands.
- A fellow eater. I like you more now.

@rule move.h.like_food_good.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_food_good
- Suggest trying the bakery together

@rule react.h.like_food_good.invite
on react
when hook=like_food_good move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes! After school, before they sell out.
- You're paying? Then yes.

@rule react.h.like_food_good.bad
on react
when hook=like_food_good fit=bad
- Don't tell me I eat too much.
- Food is happiness. That's all.

@rule day.h.like_food_low
on day
when newlike=food low=yes
hook like_food_low
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel sad
- Bad. They ran out of yakisoba bread before I got there. I've been sad since.
- Not good. I skipped breakfast and lunch was tiny. Food is the only thing that fixes days like this.
- Rough. All I can think about is my mom's curry tonight.

@rule move.h.like_food_low.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_food_low
- Ask what her mom's curry is like

@rule react.h.like_food_low.ask
on react
when hook=like_food_low move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Sweet, with big potatoes. The best in the world.
- It's the only thing that fixes everything.

@rule move.h.like_food_low.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=like_food_low
- Say there's always tomorrow's yakisoba bread

@rule react.h.like_food_low.comfort
on react
when hook=like_food_low move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...You're right. I'll run faster tomorrow.
- Hehe. Tomorrow, then.

@rule move.h.like_food_low.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_food_low
- Offer to buy her something to eat now

@rule react.h.like_food_low.invite
on react
when hook=like_food_low move=invite fit=good|neutral
- ...Really? Yes. Thank you.
- You're saving my life.

@rule react.h.like_food_low.bad
on react
when hook=like_food_low fit=bad
- Don't laugh. It matters.
- Never mind.

@rule day.h.like_cooking_good
on day
when newlike=cooking low=no
hook like_cooking_good
opens ask,praise,invite
feel smile
- Good! I tried a new recipe last night and it actually came out right.
- I made my own bento today. The tamagoyaki is perfect, if I say so myself.
- Home economics was today. I got to teach my group how to fold dumplings.

@rule move.h.like_cooking_good.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_cooking_good
- Ask what she made

@rule react.h.like_cooking_good.ask
on react
when hook=like_cooking_good move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Stewed pork. Three hours. Worth it.
- Tamagoyaki, rice balls, and a tiny octopus sausage.

@rule move.h.like_cooking_good.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_cooking_good
- Ask if you can try her cooking sometime

@rule react.h.like_cooking_good.invite
on react
when hook=like_cooking_good move=invite fit=good|neutral
- ...Really? Okay. I'll make you something.
- Then I'll make two bentos tomorrow.

@rule move.h.like_cooking_good.praise
on move.praise
when hook=like_cooking_good
- Say she must be a great cook

@rule react.h.like_cooking_good.praise
on react
when hook=like_cooking_good move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Ehe... I'm okay. I practice a lot.
- I'll let you decide. Want a bite?

@rule react.h.like_cooking_good.bad
on react
when hook=like_cooking_good fit=bad
- You don't have to pretend.
- Fine. More for me.

@rule day.h.like_cooking_low
on day
when newlike=cooking low=yes
hook like_cooking_low
opens ask,comfort,praise
feel sad
- Bad. I just want to go home and cook something. It's the only thing that calms me down.
- Not good. Even my bento came out wrong this morning, and that's usually the one good thing.
- Rough. Tonight I'm making soup. Soup fixes days like this.

@rule move.h.like_cooking_low.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_cooking_low
- Ask what she'll make tonight

@rule react.h.like_cooking_low.ask
on react
when hook=like_cooking_low move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Miso soup. Something simple, with my hands busy.
- Curry. Lots of chopping. It helps.

@rule move.h.like_cooking_low.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=like_cooking_low
- Say cooking sounds like a good way to unwind

@rule react.h.like_cooking_low.comfort
on react
when hook=like_cooking_low move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- It is. It's the only quiet I get.
- Yeah. It helps more than talking.

@rule move.h.like_cooking_low.praise
on move.praise
when hook=like_cooking_low
- Say her bento probably still tasted good

@rule react.h.like_cooking_low.praise
on react
when hook=like_cooking_low move=praise fit=good|neutral
- ...You didn't even try it. ...Thanks, though.
- Maybe. A little.

@rule react.h.like_cooking_low.bad
on react
when hook=like_cooking_low fit=bad
- Never mind.
- You wouldn't get it.

@rule day.h.like_exercise_good
on day
when newlike=exercise low=no
hook like_exercise_good
opens ask,praise,invite
feel laugh
- Great! I beat my best time in the morning run.
- Good! I did an extra set at practice and I still feel like running.
- I jogged to school today. Felt amazing. I'm still buzzing.

@rule move.h.like_exercise_good.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_exercise_good
- Ask how far she ran

@rule react.h.like_exercise_good.ask
on react
when hook=like_exercise_good move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Five kilometers. Before breakfast.
- All the way from the station. Without stopping.

@rule move.h.like_exercise_good.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_exercise_good
- Suggest running together sometime

@rule react.h.like_exercise_good.invite
on react
when hook=like_exercise_good move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes! Tomorrow morning. Don't oversleep.
- Okay. Try to keep up.

@rule move.h.like_exercise_good.praise
on move.praise
when hook=like_exercise_good
- Say she's got a lot of stamina

@rule react.h.like_exercise_good.praise
on react
when hook=like_exercise_good move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Hehe. Years of practice.
- I could go again right now.

@rule react.h.like_exercise_good.bad
on react
when hook=like_exercise_good fit=bad
- Don't call me a jock.
- Fine. I'll run alone.

@rule day.h.like_exercise_low
on day
when newlike=exercise low=yes
hook like_exercise_low
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel sad
- Bad. I couldn't go to practice today, and I'm going crazy without a run.
- Not good. When days are like this, I run until I can't think. I haven't had the chance yet.
- Rough. The track was closed. That was my only plan for feeling better.

@rule move.h.like_exercise_low.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_exercise_low
- Ask why she couldn't go to practice

@rule react.h.like_exercise_low.ask
on react
when hook=like_exercise_low move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The coach cancelled. I need to move.
- Too much homework. I hate it.

@rule move.h.like_exercise_low.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=like_exercise_low
- Say she can run it off after school

@rule react.h.like_exercise_low.comfort
on react
when hook=like_exercise_low move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Yeah. That's the plan.
- Thanks. I'll feel better after.

@rule move.h.like_exercise_low.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_exercise_low
- Offer to go for a run with her later

@rule react.h.like_exercise_low.invite
on react
when hook=like_exercise_low move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You'd come? Okay. Slowly, for you.
- Yes. Let's go after the bell.

@rule react.h.like_exercise_low.bad
on react
when hook=like_exercise_low fit=bad
- Never mind.
- You don't get it.

@rule day.h.like_study_good
on day
when newlike=study low=no
hook like_study_good
opens ask,praise,share
feel smile
- Good! The teacher solved a problem I'd been stuck on for days. I almost clapped.
- I spent the free period in the library and finished a whole chapter ahead.
- Great. I got my test back. Top of the class. Don't tell anyone I'm happy about it.

@rule move.h.like_study_good.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_study_good
- Ask which subject she likes most

@rule react.h.like_study_good.ask
on react
when hook=like_study_good move=ask fit=good|neutral
- History. All the stories.
- Math, honestly. Problems have answers.

@rule move.h.like_study_good.share
on move.share
when hook=like_study_good
- Say you like learning new things too

@rule react.h.like_study_good.share
on react
when hook=like_study_good move=share fit=good|neutral
- Really? Then we should study together.
- Good. Most people think I'm weird.

@rule move.h.like_study_good.praise
on move.praise
when hook=like_study_good
- Say she's really smart

@rule react.h.like_study_good.praise
on react
when hook=like_study_good move=praise fit=good|neutral
- ...I just like it. That's all.
- Hehe. Say it louder.

@rule react.h.like_study_good.bad
on react
when hook=like_study_good fit=bad
- Don't call me a nerd.
- Fine. I'll keep it to myself.

@rule day.h.like_study_low
on day
when newlike=study low=yes
hook like_study_low
opens ask,comfort,praise
feel sad
- Bad. The only good part was the hour in the library. Books don't argue with me.
- Not good. I've been reading under the desk all day to get through it.
- Rough. When things go wrong, I study. It's the only thing that goes right.

@rule move.h.like_study_low.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_study_low
- Ask what she's reading

@rule react.h.like_study_low.ask
on react
when hook=like_study_low move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A history book. Old wars. It's calming. Weirdly.
- A math workbook. Problems I can actually solve.

@rule move.h.like_study_low.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=like_study_low
- Say it's okay to hide in a book sometimes

@rule react.h.like_study_low.comfort
on react
when hook=like_study_low move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Thanks. I needed to hear that.
- Yeah. Just for a while.

@rule move.h.like_study_low.praise
on move.praise
when hook=like_study_low
- Say it's impressive that studying calms her

@rule react.h.like_study_low.praise
on react
when hook=like_study_low move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Hehe. Most people say it's weird.
- Thank you. It works.

@rule react.h.like_study_low.bad
on react
when hook=like_study_low fit=bad
- Never mind.
- You wouldn't understand.

@rule day.h.like_fashion_good
on day
when newlike=fashion low=no
hook like_fashion_good
opens ask,praise,tease
feel smile
- Good! I tied my ribbon a new way this morning. Nobody noticed. You noticed, right?
- I spent the break reading a fashion magazine. I've already planned my next three outfits.
- Great. I found a skirt on sale yesterday. I've been dying to wear it.

@rule move.h.like_fashion_good.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_fashion_good
- Ask what she's planning to wear

@rule react.h.like_fashion_good.ask
on react
when hook=like_fashion_good move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A blue skirt and the white cardigan. Classic.
- It's a surprise. Weekend outfit.

@rule move.h.like_fashion_good.tease
on move.tease
when hook=like_fashion_good
- Say she spends more time on outfits than homework

@rule react.h.like_fashion_good.tease
on react
when hook=like_fashion_good move=tease fit=good|neutral
- ...Maybe. Priorities.
- Outfits are homework.

@rule move.h.like_fashion_good.praise
on move.praise
when hook=like_fashion_good
- Say the ribbon looks good

@rule react.h.like_fashion_good.praise
on react
when hook=like_fashion_good move=praise fit=good|neutral
- ...You noticed! I knew it.
- Hehe. Took me twenty minutes.

@rule react.h.like_fashion_good.bad
on react
when hook=like_fashion_good fit=bad
- You didn't notice, did you.
- Never mind.

@rule day.h.like_fashion_low
on day
when newlike=fashion low=yes
hook like_fashion_low
opens ask,comfort,praise
feel sad
- Bad. Even my outfit couldn't save today, and I picked it so carefully.
- Not good. I just want to go shopping and forget about everything.
- Rough. When I'm like this, I scroll through clothes for hours. I've been doing it all lunch.

@rule move.h.like_fashion_low.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_fashion_low
- Ask what she'd buy if she could

@rule react.h.like_fashion_low.ask
on react
when hook=like_fashion_low move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A coat. A nice wool one. I've wanted it for months.
- Everything in the window on the corner.

@rule move.h.like_fashion_low.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=like_fashion_low
- Say a shopping trip might cheer her up

@rule react.h.like_fashion_low.comfort
on react
when hook=like_fashion_low move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Yeah. Maybe this weekend.
- Come with me? To hold bags?

@rule move.h.like_fashion_low.praise
on move.praise
when hook=like_fashion_low
- Say she still looks nice today

@rule react.h.like_fashion_low.praise
on react
when hook=like_fashion_low move=praise fit=good|neutral
- ...Really? Thanks. That helps.
- You're just being nice. Keep going.

@rule react.h.like_fashion_low.bad
on react
when hook=like_fashion_low fit=bad
- Never mind.
- It's not just clothes.

@rule day.h.like_coffee_good
on day
when newlike=coffee low=no
hook like_coffee_good
opens ask,share,invite
feel smile
- Good. I found a café near the station that does real pour-over. Black. Perfect.
- Great. I had my first coffee at six and I've been sharp all day.
- Nice. The vending machine finally restocked the black coffee.

@rule move.h.like_coffee_good.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_coffee_good
- Ask what's special about the café

@rule react.h.like_coffee_good.ask
on react
when hook=like_coffee_good move=ask fit=good|neutral
- They grind it right in front of you. The smell alone.
- No sugar on the tables. They know.

@rule move.h.like_coffee_good.share
on move.share
when hook=like_coffee_good
- Say you drink yours black too

@rule react.h.like_coffee_good.share
on react
when hook=like_coffee_good move=share fit=good|neutral
- Really? Respect.
- Finally. Everyone else drinks milk with sugar.

@rule move.h.like_coffee_good.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_coffee_good
- Suggest going to the café together

@rule react.h.like_coffee_good.invite
on react
when hook=like_coffee_good move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes. I'll order for you.
- Okay. My treat this time.

@rule react.h.like_coffee_good.bad
on react
when hook=like_coffee_good fit=bad
- Don't say it's bitter.
- Fine. Drink your juice.

@rule day.h.like_coffee_low
on day
when newlike=coffee low=yes
hook like_coffee_low
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel sad
- Bad. I didn't even get my morning coffee. That's how it started.
- Not good. I've had three black coffees and it's still not enough.
- Rough. All I want is a quiet café and a black coffee.

@rule move.h.like_coffee_low.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_coffee_low
- Ask why she missed it

@rule react.h.like_coffee_low.ask
on react
when hook=like_coffee_low move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The machine was broken. The whole day went wrong after that.
- I overslept. No time.

@rule move.h.like_coffee_low.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=like_coffee_low
- Say a quiet coffee might help

@rule react.h.like_coffee_low.comfort
on react
when hook=like_coffee_low move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Yeah. It always does.
- Just one cup. In silence.

@rule move.h.like_coffee_low.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_coffee_low
- Offer to buy her one now

@rule react.h.like_coffee_low.invite
on react
when hook=like_coffee_low move=invite fit=good|neutral
- ...Black, no sugar? Yes. Thank you.
- You know the way to my heart.

@rule react.h.like_coffee_low.bad
on react
when hook=like_coffee_low fit=bad
- Never mind.
- It's not about the coffee.

@rule day.h.like_spicy_good
on day
when newlike=spicy low=no
hook like_spicy_good
opens ask,tease,invite
feel laugh
- Great! The cafeteria had the spicy curry today. I asked for extra chili.
- Good. I found a ramen place that does level ten spicy. I finished it.
- Nice. My lips are still tingling from lunch. Mapo tofu.

@rule move.h.like_spicy_good.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_spicy_good
- Ask how spicy level ten really is

@rule react.h.like_spicy_good.ask
on react
when hook=like_spicy_good move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Your face would melt. Mine didn't.
- They make you sign a paper first.

@rule move.h.like_spicy_good.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_spicy_good
- Suggest trying the ramen place together

@rule react.h.like_spicy_good.invite
on react
when hook=like_spicy_good move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes! But you have to try level five at least.
- Okay. I'll laugh at you.

@rule move.h.like_spicy_good.tease
on move.tease
when hook=like_spicy_good
- Say she must have a tongue of steel

@rule react.h.like_spicy_good.tease
on react
when hook=like_spicy_good move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Hehe. Steel and fire.
- Try me sometime.

@rule react.h.like_spicy_good.bad
on react
when hook=like_spicy_good fit=bad
- Spicy isn't scary, you are.
- Fine. More for me.

@rule day.h.like_spicy_low
on day
when newlike=spicy low=yes
hook like_spicy_low
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel sad
- Bad. The only thing that'll fix today is something so spicy I forget about it.
- Not good. I'm going to get the hottest curry I can find after school.
- Rough. When I'm like this, I eat chili until I cry. Then at least I know why I'm crying.

@rule move.h.like_spicy_low.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_spicy_low
- Ask where she'll get it

@rule react.h.like_spicy_low.ask
on react
when hook=like_spicy_low move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The ramen place by the station. Level ten.
- My dad's chili oil. He hides it. I know where.

@rule move.h.like_spicy_low.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=like_spicy_low
- Say that sounds like a plan

@rule react.h.like_spicy_low.comfort
on react
when hook=like_spicy_low move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Yeah. It works. Every time.
- Thanks for not calling me weird.

@rule move.h.like_spicy_low.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_spicy_low
- Offer to come along

@rule react.h.like_spicy_low.invite
on react
when hook=like_spicy_low move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You'll cry. ...Come anyway.
- Okay. But you're getting level three.

@rule react.h.like_spicy_low.bad
on react
when hook=like_spicy_low fit=bad
- Never mind.
- It's how I deal.

@rule day.h.like_sweets_good
on day
when newlike=sweets low=no
hook like_sweets_good
opens ask,share,invite
feel smile
- Good! The shop had the strawberry cream buns today. I bought two. Both are gone.
- Great. My friend brought homemade cookies. I may have eaten half.
- Nice. I'm going to the crepe stand after school. I've been thinking about it all day.

@rule move.h.like_sweets_good.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_sweets_good
- Ask what kind of crepe she'll get

@rule react.h.like_sweets_good.ask
on react
when hook=like_sweets_good move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Strawberry, chocolate, extra cream. Always.
- Banana and custard. It's the best.

@rule move.h.like_sweets_good.share
on move.share
when hook=like_sweets_good
- Say you have a sweet tooth too

@rule react.h.like_sweets_good.share
on react
when hook=like_sweets_good move=share fit=good|neutral
- Really? Then you have to come with me.
- Hehe. I knew you were sweet.

@rule move.h.like_sweets_good.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_sweets_good
- Suggest going to the crepe stand together

@rule react.h.like_sweets_good.invite
on react
when hook=like_sweets_good move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Yes! You can try mine. One bite.
- Okay! But I'm getting two.

@rule react.h.like_sweets_good.bad
on react
when hook=like_sweets_good fit=bad
- Don't tell me it's unhealthy.
- Fine. All mine.

@rule day.h.like_sweets_low
on day
when newlike=sweets low=yes
hook like_sweets_low
opens ask,comfort,invite
feel sad
- Bad. I ate my emergency chocolate at second period. It's been downhill since.
- Not good. I need a whole cake. Maybe two.
- Rough. When I'm like this, only something sweet helps. I'm out of candy.

@rule move.h.like_sweets_low.ask
on move.ask
when hook=like_sweets_low
- Ask what her emergency chocolate is

@rule react.h.like_sweets_low.ask
on react
when hook=like_sweets_low move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Milk chocolate, the little squares. I always have some.
- Strawberry chocolate. Don't laugh.

@rule move.h.like_sweets_low.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=like_sweets_low
- Say a cake sounds like a fair plan

@rule react.h.like_sweets_low.comfort
on react
when hook=like_sweets_low move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Right? It's practically medicine.
- Thanks. I knew you'd understand.

@rule move.h.like_sweets_low.invite
on move.invite
when hook=like_sweets_low
- Offer to get her something sweet

@rule react.h.like_sweets_low.invite
on react
when hook=like_sweets_low move=invite fit=good|neutral
- ...You would? Yes. Anything with cream.
- You're the best. Really.

@rule react.h.like_sweets_low.bad
on react
when hook=like_sweets_low fit=bad
- Never mind.
- Don't judge me.

@rule small.more.s1
on small
when subject=weekend period=after
- Finally, the weekend's close. I can feel it.
- One more day and I'm sleeping until noon.
- I have nothing planned for the weekend. It's perfect.
- My weekend plan is no plans.

@rule small.more.s2
on small
when subject=school mood=stressed
- Classes are piling up. I can't keep track anymore.
- Three assignments due this week. I don't know how.
- Every teacher thinks theirs is the only class.
- I need a week off from school. Just one.

@rule small.more.s3
on small
when subject=movies rel=friend
- There's a movie I've been waiting for. Friday. I'm going.
- I watched an old movie last night. Cried at the end. Again.
- I like movies where nobody gets hurt. Is that boring?
- I always fall asleep at the cinema. Always.

@rule small.more.s4
on small
when subject=phone favor>=60
- My phone's full of pictures of the sky. Don't ask.
- I keep my favorite messages. I reread them sometimes.
- My battery dies by lunch. Every day.
- I changed my wallpaper. Guess what it is. ...No, not you.

@rule small.more.s5
on small
when subject=season outside=yes
- You can smell the season changing out here.
- The trees look different every week now.
- I like this time of year. The light's softer.
- It's the kind of day you want to remember.

@rule small.more.x1
on small
when subject=weekend rel=girlfriend period=after
- So... are we doing something this weekend? I kept it free.
- I didn't make any plans. In case someone asked me.
- I told my mom I'd be out on Saturday. She asked with who. I didn't answer.
- If you're free this weekend, so am I.

@rule small.more.x2
on small
when subject=school mood=sleepy exam=yes
- I studied until three. I don't remember any of it.
- My notes are a mess and my eyes keep closing.
- If I fall asleep during the exam, wake me up.
- I dreamed about the exam. I failed it in the dream too.

@rule small.more.x3
on small
when subject=commute wet=yes rel=friend|lover|girlfriend
- The bus was packed with wet umbrellas. Mine poked someone.
- My shoes are still squishing from the walk in.
- If it's still raining later, can we walk to the station together?
- I share umbrellas with friends. Just saying.

@rule day.more.s1
on day
when mood=cheerful period=lunch
- Good! Lunch was great and the afternoon's short today.
- I'm in a good mood. The bento came out perfect.
- Great! I got a good grade this morning, and now it's lunch.
- Today's going well. I don't want to jinx it.

@rule day.more.s2
on day
when mood=upset rel=acquaintance
- Not great, honestly. But I don't really want to get into it.
- It's been a bad one. I'll be fine.
- ...Today was a lot. Let's leave it at that.
- Rough. Thanks for asking, though.

@rule day.more.s3
on day
when mood=bored placeid=classroom
- Boring. Six hours in this chair. My legs are asleep.
- I've been staring at the clock since second period.
- Nothing happened. Nothing at all.
- I counted the ceiling tiles. There are a hundred and twelve.

@rule day.more.s4
on day
when mood=lonely hasclub!=yes
- Kind of quiet. Everyone's off at their clubs.
- I didn't really talk to anyone today. Until now.
- It's been lonely. Thanks for coming by.
- Quiet day. Too quiet.

@rule day.more.s5
on day
when mood=sleepy period=day
- So tired. Morning classes are a crime.
- I can barely keep my eyes open. Talk to me so I stay awake.
- Sleepy. I stayed up reading. Worth it. Mostly.
- I yawned in front of the teacher. She saw.

@rule day.more.x1
on day
when mood=cheerful rel=girlfriend period=after
- Great, now that you're here. I was waiting for school to end.
- Good. The best part was knowing I'd see you after class.
- Today was fine. Now it's better.
- I saved my good mood for you.

@rule day.more.x2
on day
when mood=stressed exam=yes favor>=50
- Bad. The exams are crushing me. But you being here helps.
- Stressed. I can't stop thinking about tomorrow's test.
- I'm a wreck. Don't look too closely.
- My head's full of formulas and none of them stay.

@rule day.more.x3
on day
when mood=upset fight=yes rel=friend|lover|girlfriend
- Bad. I fought with {fightwho} and I keep replaying it.
- Not great. {fightwho} and I aren't talking.
- It's {fightwho}. I don't know how to fix it.
- I said something mean to {fightwho}. I didn't mean it.

@rule us.more.s1
on us
when verb=walked_home
- Walking home with you was nice. The road felt shorter.
- I liked our walk home. Let's do it again.
- I keep thinking about the walk home.
- The way home is better with you.

@rule us.more.s2
on us
when verb=ate_with
- Eating with you was fun. Lunch is better with company.
- I liked our lunch. You eat really fast, by the way.
- We should eat together more.
- You stole one of my sausages. I noticed.

@rule us.more.s3
on us
when verb=helped
- Thanks for helping me the other day. I mean it.
- I still owe you for that.
- You didn't have to help, but you did.
- I'll pay you back. Somehow.

@rule us.more.s4
on us
when verb=gave_gift
